---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: atmosphere::resources::GpuAtmosphere · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**GpuAtmosphere**<br/>以 Uniform 格式描述大气几何与地面。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​atmosphere​_​buffers**<br/>上传各视图的大气和采样设置缓冲。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract​_​atmosphere**<br/>为三维相机选择并提取最近的大气。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​atmosphere​_​uniforms**<br/>把提取的大气几何转换为 GPU Uniform 组<br/>件。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​atmosphere​_​transforms**<br/>按相机位置构造大气局部坐标变换。" }
  class n4 node_system
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​uniform​_​components**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：将组件值批量<br/>上传为动态着色器参数。" }
  class n5 node_system
  class n5 external_node
  n0 e0@--> n1
  class e0 edge_read
  n2 e1@-->|"移除"| n0
  class e1 edge_write
  n3 e2@-->|"插入"| n0
  class e2 edge_write
  n0 e3@--> n4
  class e3 edge_read
  n0 e4@--> n5
  class e4 edge_read
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e1@{ curve: basis }
  e2@{ curve: basis }
  e4@{ curve: basis }
